  <h2>How a Fatwa is Written</h2>
  <p>Every fatwa follows the same structure:</p>
  <ol>
    <li><strong>Question</strong>: the query, stated clearly.</li>
    <li><strong>Short Answer</strong>: the ruling in one or two lines.</li>
    <li><strong>Explanation</strong>: two paragraphs from the primary Ḥanafī sources.</li>
    <li><strong>Supplementary Sources</strong>: further works supporting the primary references.</li>
    <li><strong>Ḥikmah</strong>: the wisdom behind the ruling.</li>
  </ol>

